    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γομφ-ίος</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδούς</span>), ὁ, more 
			Att.
		 than <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Moer.
			111
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόμφος</span>): —<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grinder-tooth, molar</i>, chiefly
			in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψοφεῖ δ᾽ ὁ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γομφίους συγκρούων</span> with
			his <i>teeth</i> chattering, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				92.8
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσθίος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				661b8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tooth of a key</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				423
			</span></i>.</div>
